UID:69dec2bdfca21471b7ef3b9d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun-filled Storytime\, where stories\, songs\, a
 nd rhymes introduce early concepts of STEM (Science\, Technology\, Enginee
 ring\, and Math). After the program\, try a hands-on craft or activity 
 based on a STEM concept!  For children ages 2-5 with a parent or caregive
