SUMMARY:Painting the Seasons - A Pipa Solo Concert
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260509T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260509T150000
UID:69b2fef41e64afd01e61ae13@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Audience will have this wonderful and rare opportunity to appr
 eciate the unique Chinese music instrument live performance.\nInternationa
 lly renowned Toronto-based Pipa artist Wen Zhao will perform a solo concer
 t celebrating China’s rich musical legacy\, with a traditional and folk 
